sequenceDiagram
  actor Learner
  participant UI as CourseCraft UI
  participant ES as Enrolment Service
  participant PA as Payment Adapter
  participant PG as Payment Provider
  participant VD as Video Delivery Adapter
  participant VS as Video Service
  participant PS as Progress Service
  participant QS as Quiz Service
  participant CS as Certificate Service
  Learner->>UI: Select course and enrol
  UI->>ES: createEnrolment(courseId)
  ES->>PA: initiatePayment(enrolmentId)
  PA->>PG: create payment request
  PG-->>PA: payment reference
  PA-->>ES: pending status + reference
  PG-->>PA: verified payment callback
  PA->>ES: activate once (idempotent)
  ES-->>UI: active/paid enrolment
  Learner->>UI: Open lesson
  UI->>ES: authorise lesson access
  ES-->>UI: access granted
  UI->>VD: request playback(assetRef)
  VD->>VS: resolve protected stream
  VS-->>VD: playback access
  VD-->>UI: playback URL/token
  Learner->>UI: Complete required lessons
  UI->>PS: record progress events
  PS-->>UI: derived completion percentage
  Learner->>UI: Submit quiz
  UI->>QS: score attempt
  QS-->>UI: score and pass/fail
  UI->>CS: evaluate(enrolment, completion, quiz)
  alt paid + 100% complete + quiz passed
    CS->>CS: issue once or return existing certificate
    CS-->>UI: certificate reference
    UI-->>Learner: Certificate available
  else one or more conditions not met
    CS-->>UI: not eligible + reason(s)
    UI-->>Learner: Show remaining requirement
  end